# 统一换行符，避免 Windows / macOS / Linux 之间协作时满屏"整个文件都改了"
* text=auto eol=lf

# 批处理文件必须是 CRLF，cmd.exe 对 LF 结尾的 .bat 处理不可靠
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不要做任何转换，否则会被改坏
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.docx binary
*.db binary
*.gguf binary

# 让 GitHub 语言统计不至于把 JSON 数据当成主要语言
data/seed/*.json linguist-vendored
tests/vendor/*.js linguist-vendored
